## OBLinux: networking (replaces releng's iwd/systemd-networkd default;
## NetworkManager is what GNOME Settings' network panel expects)
networkmanager

## OBLinux: AUR support (paru is built on first login, see
## /usr/local/bin/oblinux-aur-bootstrap). base-devel/git/rust are its build
## deps — rust ships pre-installed (cargo) rather than downloaded at first
## login, since paru is written in Rust and pulling the whole toolchain
## over the network during a live session would make first login slow.
base-devel
git
rust

## OBLinux: boot splash (theme: airootfs/usr/share/plymouth/themes/oblinux)
plymouth
